        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Good morning. I'd like to check the school schedule before class."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Sure. The principal updated the timetable this morning."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "We should inform the other teachers about the change."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "I have already sent them an email with the new details."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Furthermore, we need to prepare worksheets for Period Three."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "I agree. If we finish early, we will have time to review."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_a",
        "text": "Let me explain the new procedure to the staff members."
      },
      {
        "character_id": "char_b",
        "text": "Thank you. Your preparation is always very helpful."
      }
    ]
